  {
    "id": "anno-mineoka_lower_p078_right-19",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "（兵員　五十八人）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（兵員（へいいん）五十八人）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troop strength: 58 men. The entire entry — label and figure alike — is enclosed in editorial parentheses: the opening 「（」 prints above 兵 and the closing 「）」 below 人 at the very foot of the column, not after 員. The compiler is supplying the whole item, not merely a heading the manuscript left implicit. A strikingly small force for a domain assessed at 15,071 koku."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "（兵員）"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
