        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "草高　壹萬三百七十九石五升六勺八才"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "草高（くさだか）一万三百七十九石余"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Sōdaka (gross assessed yield) = 10,379.05068 koku. The page decomposes it exactly into 高 10,000 + 込高新田 379.05068. Note the formal 壹萬 here, against the plain 一萬 used in the 高 column two positions to the left. Sub-koku places skip 斗 and 合 (both zero): 5 升 + 6 勺 + 8 才."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "草高（三草藩分）"
      }
    ],
